            <div class="article__body"><p class="text-align-justify"><span lang="EN-US">The European Fund and Asset Management Association&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-GB">(EFAMA)&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US">has released today a new issue of its Market Insights series titled&nbsp;<strong>“Fund redemptions amid periods of shock: evidence f</strong></span></p></div>
      
