      <div class="field-date"> 05 July 2023 </div>
      <h2>
        <a  href="/newsroom/news/open-ended-funds-and-resilient-capital-markets-perspective-european-asset-management" class="no-ajax slide-content"
          hide="true"
          rel="bookmark">
<span>Open-ended funds and resilient capital markets - the perspective of the European asset management industry</span>
</a>
      </h2>
      
            <div class="article__body"><p><span><span><span lang="EN-US"><span>For the best part of this decade, macro-prudential supervisors have argued that investment funds contribute to the build-up of systemic risks. Today, EFAMA has published an ambitious report that provides a comprehensive overview of the contribution of the European investment fund sector to the diversity and resilience of capital markets.</span></span></span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><strong><span><span><span>Some key findings include:</span></span></span></strong></p></div>
      
      <div class="read-more">
        <a  href="/newsroom/news/open-ended-funds-and-resilient-capital-markets-perspective-european-asset-management" class="no-ajax slide-content" >more</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</div>
    <div class="views-row">
<article class="main-type-publication node node--promoted article article--teaser">
      <div>
      <div class="picture-container">
        
            <div class="empty-fields empty-fields__nbsp article__field-news-type">Publication</div>
      
        <a  href="/newsroom/news/efama-market-insights-issue-2-mmfs-europe-state-play" class="no-ajax slide-content"
          hide="true">
        
            <div class="article__field-image">  
<img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/styles/large/public/assets/policy_topics/EU-regulation_Photo%20by%20Guillaume%20Pe%CC%81rigois%20on%20Unsplash.jpg?h=9deca117&amp;itok=1LV35T-8" width="480" height="331" alt="EU regulation picture" class="img-fluid" />


</div>
      
        </a>
      </div>
      
      <div class="article__field-topic">
              <div class="field__item">EU Fund regulation</div>
              <div class="field__item">Money Market Funds</div>
              <div class="field__item">Financial stability</div>
          </div>
  
      <div class="field-date"> 08 October 2020 </div>
      <h2>
        <a  href="/newsroom/news/efama-market-insights-issue-2-mmfs-europe-state-play" class="no-ajax slide-content"
          hide="true"
          rel="bookmark">
<span>EFAMA Market Insights | Issue #2 | MMFs in Europe | State of Play</span>
</a>
      </h2>
      
            <div class="article__body"><p>The growth in MMF net assets occurred against the backdrop of resolute actions by governments and monetary authorities&nbsp;<br>
across the world to mitigate the impact of the Covid-19 crisis.&nbsp;</p></div>
      
      <div class="read-more">
        <a  href="/newsroom/news/efama-market-insights-issue-2-mmfs-europe-state-play" class="no-ajax slide-content" >more</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
